   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 75,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 75,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The insight Theme answers questions about one data extract,\nclimbing Data → Information → Knowledge → Wisdom.",
   "originalText": "The insight Theme answers questions about one data extract,\nclimbing Data → Information → Knowledge → Wisdom.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-628ed3c7fea4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 108.0,
   "y": 556.5,
   "width": 568.51625,
   "height": 100.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "s-1fa61f889397",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 76,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 76,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Its new layout is a task Block (tasks/b5N_<topic>_dikw/,\nworkbench: insight): one Job per level (j01_data …\nj04_wisdom), one Task per question (tNN_<question>/), one\nhard Run per dataset × partition …",
   "originalText": "Its new layout is a task Block (tasks/b5N_<topic>_dikw/,\nworkbench: insight): one Job per level (j01_data …\nj04_wisdom), one Task per question (tNN_<question>/), one\nhard Run per dataset × partition …",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-a826e06fd132",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 108.0,
   "y": 662.5,
   "width": 597.964375,
   "height": 75.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "s-1fa61f889397",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 77,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 77,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The older register board (insights/<Dataset>-InsightBoard/:\nboard.md, 0-MT-meta/, one folder per partition) keeps its layout\nuntil it is carried over.",
   "originalText": "The older register board (insights/<Dataset>-InsightBoard/:\nboard.md, 0-MT-meta/, one folder per partition) keeps its layout\nuntil it is carried over.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-77d6e568ce3a",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 108.0,
   "y": 743.5,
   "width": 603.860625,
   "height": 100.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "s-1fa61f889397",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 78,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 78,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Today the Insight workbench shows all of it at Block level, in\nfive Spaces (Scope · Prototype · Insight · Check · Delivery), with\nthe levels as Views of Prototype and the partitions as Views of\nInsight.",
   "originalText": "Today the Insight workbench shows all of it at Block level, in\nfive Spaces (Scope · Prototype · Insight · Check · Delivery), with\nthe levels as Views of Prototype and the partitions as Views of\nInsight.",
